OL,3,AMy approach to EU is pragmatic, says
OL,4,ABurnham
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter several former prime ministers
OL,7,Furged him to not reopen the Brexit
OL,8,Fdebate, Burnham said they are "stuck in
OL,9,Fthe past" - and later claimed there
OL,10,Fwould be "no banging on about Europe"
OL,11,Ffrom Labour.
OL,13,FConservative Party leader Kemi Badenoch
OL,14,Fsaid Burnham has "oversold" the deal
OL,15,Fand was "trying to take Britain back to
OL,16,F2015".
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
